Z||000018||PAUL88GT||07-09-2001||05:39 PM||||I think Stimpy is on track with his diagnosis of the problem.  Jealousy is a strong emotion.  Most males have a one-track mind.||||reg||1
Z||000019||Formula88||07-09-2001||06:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by PAUL88GT:<BR><B>I think Stimpy is on track with his diagnosis of the problem.  Jealousy is a strong emotion.  Most males have a one-track mind.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I have to agree, but in my case, where does that leave me?  We were best friends before she met him.  Now that they're together, we have to flush our friendship?  That may be the end result, but ... damn. ||||reg||9
