Z||000022||GT Bastard||07-10-2001||09:11 PM||||I feel your pain, people... The last few months have been nothing short of crazy in my life.  I break up with my girlfriend of 3 years, meet an amazing chick who turns out to be someone that I don't even want to know anymore.... Then my former "best friend" gets together with my 'ex(whom I still had feelings for) and hell breaks loose.  I'm back together with her now, but things are taking awhile to get back to normal.  I've never been so "pi$$ed-off, hurt, jealous, regretful" in my whole life.  Instead of having my former best friend, I've got an aquaintance that I occasionally small-talk with.  Worst of all, I hate the way that relationships can make a person feel so helpless.  I mean, just when you think you've got control over your life...  Life and relationships are fragile.  All I can say is:  Don't break someone's heart just because you think there might be something better out there... You may have regrets that are more serious than you ever anticipated.  ||||reg||3
