Z||000024||Fierokid87||07-11-2001||11:29 AM||||Well as Craig stated we both lost a good friend.  I also lost my brother 10 years ago.  It like one minut that person is there and the next he is no where to be seen.  It leaves an epty gap in your life that nothing can fill.  <P>Scott<P>------------------<BR>Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||1
